From 29878eb5f29cf89345feda2d865b66e7a0a201f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:02:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(ui): G-code window - selectable text, highlighted
 trace line, click a line to trace

Code is selectable and copyable without the gutter numbers, the cursor
row has a background band, a click on a row moves the cursor there, and
the trace view no longer blows the window up to thousands of pixels
(Sides replaced by fixed rects). Viewer moved from pages.rs to
gcode_view.rs.

Fixes #1089

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
